        (1, N'BASE', N'Baseline planning week', N'Planning', '2026-02-12', '2026-02-18', N'Expected conditions for the planning week Thu 2026-02-12 to Wed 2026-02-18. The calendar already contains Valentines Day (Sat) and Presidents Day (Mon); teams must forecast those effects themselves. Demand multiplier = 1.00.', N'Forecast'),
