        (3, N'DISRUPT', N'Callouts / reduced availability', N'Planning', '2026-02-12', '2026-02-18', N'Baseline demand, but an illness cluster at Warehouse 2 (Feb 13-16) and a short receiving crew at Warehouse 4 (Feb 12-13) reduce available employees and overtime capacity.', N'Scenario-generated');
